{"type": "result", "subtype": "success", "is_error": false, "duration_ms": 1106576, "duration_api_ms": 1053210, "num_turns": 39, "result": "Review complete. The paper receives a **Weak Accept (6.4/10)**.\n\nKey findings from the full-text review:\n- **Strongest axiom (Object, 9/10):** Cocktail-party AVSR is a real, well-defined, important problem with clear operationalization via CHiME-9 MCoRec\n- **Weakest point (Identification, 6/10):** Systems change multiple dimensions simultaneously (data, architecture, inference), limiting causal attribution — though acceptable for an analysis-type paper\n- **Core insight:** \"Overlap alone doesn't explain performance differences\" is the most novel finding, supported by cross-speaker confusion rate evidence (31-53% vs 14%)\n- **Practical gap:** No analysis code released, limited session sample for key qualitative findings", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "fa2d2247-9744-476c-9dbc-83a3513d5460", "total_cost_usd": 4.615360000000001, "usage": {"input_tokens": 881232, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 8368, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "", "iterations": [], "speed": "standard"}, "modelUsage": {"GLM-5.2-w4a8": {"inputTokens": 881232, "outputTokens": 8368, "cacheReadInputTokens": 0, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 0, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 4.615360000000001, "contextWindow": 200000, "maxOutputTokens": 32000}}, "permission_denials": [], "fast_mode_state": "off", "uuid": "cf861b81-a9c0-460f-9842-fef9115cff83"}
